/*
 * Localized display names for the Odyssey suit tools.
 *
 * Source: the in-game tool localisation tables.
 *
 * Credit and licence terms: ATTRIBUTIONS.md. Acquisition, revisions, derivation and
 * known gaps: data/i18n/SOURCES.md.
 *
 * Keyed by the library id data/equipment/tools.jsonc carries, which stays authoritative
 * for the canonical English name. Frontier publishes no item symbol for a tool, so the
 * id is the one identifier a consumer holds. SOURCES.md records the join and which
 * values the game leaves in English.
 */
